#: ../../howto/install.rst:1
msgid "Build and install Guidedog"
msgstr "构建并安装 Guidedog"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:4
msgid "Install on macOS with Homebrew"
msgstr "在 macOS 上用 Homebrew 安装"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:7
msgid ""
"Use the official ``insanai/homebrew-guidedog`` tap on Apple silicon or "
"Intel Macs:"
msgstr ""
"在 Apple 芯片或 Intel 芯片的 Mac 上，使用官方 tap ``insanai/homebrew-guidedog`` 安装："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:15
msgid ""
"Homebrew selects the release archive for our processor and checks its "
"SHA-256. The executable has the Typst compiler and Graphviz built in, so "
"it needs nothing else at run time. We do not need a Rust toolchain, a "
"Python environment, or a separate Typst installation to build HTML and "
"PDF. The release requires macOS 12 or later."
msgstr ""
"Homebrew 会为我们的处理器选择对应的发行包，并校验其 SHA-256。可执行文件内置了 Typst 编译器和 "
"Graphviz，运行时不再需要其他任何东西。构建 HTML 和 PDF 不需要 Rust 工具链、Python 环境，也不需要单独安装 "
"Typst。此版本要求 macOS 12 或更高版本。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:19
msgid ""
"The package also installs ``guidedog pages``, which publishes sites to "
"GitHub Pages (see :doc:`github-pages`), and ``graphdog``. Discussion "
"catalogs need no program of their own: ``guidedog dsc`` keeps them (see "
":doc:`discussions`)."
msgstr ""
"这个包还会安装 ``guidedog pages``\\ （用于把网站发布到 GitHub Pages，见 :doc:`github-pages`）和 "
"``graphdog``。讨论目录不需要单独的程序：由 ``guidedog dsc`` 维护（见 :doc:`discussions`）。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:21
msgid ""
"We create our first project in :doc:`../tutorial/first-project`. To "
"update an installed release:"
msgstr "我们在 :doc:`../tutorial/first-project` 中创建第一个项目。更新已安装的版本："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:29
msgid ""
"Run ``brew test insanai/guidedog/guidedog`` to check the installed "
"package by creating a project and building HTML and PDF."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``brew test insanai/guidedog/guidedog`` 检查已安装的包。测试会创建项目并生成 HTML 和 PDF。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:32
msgid "Build from source"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:35
msgid "Guidedog is a Cargo workspace. We need:"
msgstr "Guidedog 是一个 Cargo workspace。我们需要："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:37
msgid ""
"a Rust toolchain at the version ``rust-version`` names in the root "
"``Cargo.toml`` (Rust 1.99 or newer; edition 2024), installed with "
"``rustup``;"
msgstr ""
"Rust 工具链，版本不低于根目录 ``Cargo.toml`` 中 ``rust-version`` 指定的版本（Rust 1.99 "
"或更新，edition 2024），用 ``rustup`` 安装；"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:39
msgid ""
"the Graphviz library, because Guidedog links it (``libgvc`` and "
"``libcgraph``) to draw graphs in process. Either install the system's "
"development files (``libgraphviz-dev`` on Debian and Ubuntu, "
"``graphviz-devel`` on Fedora, ``graphviz`` from Homebrew on macOS), or "
"build static libraries with ``cargo xtask graphviz`` (see below);"
msgstr ""
"Graphviz 库，因为 Guidedog 链接它（``libgvc`` 和 "
"``libcgraph``），在进程内绘制图形。可以安装系统的开发文件（Debian 和 Ubuntu 上是 "
"``libgraphviz-dev``，Fedora 上是 ``graphviz-devel``，macOS 上是 Homebrew 的 "
"``graphviz``），也可以用 ``cargo xtask graphviz`` 构建静态库（见下文）；"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:40
msgid ""
"a C compiler (``cc``, Xcode's command-line tools, or MSVC), which Cargo "
"uses to build the tree-sitter grammars and the cryptography in the "
"``ring`` crate (TLS for HTTPS)."
msgstr ""
"C 编译器（``cc``、Xcode 命令行工具或 MSVC），Cargo 用它构建 tree-sitter 语法以及 ``ring`` crate "
"中的密码学代码（HTTPS 所用的 TLS）。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:42
msgid ""
"Nothing else is built by hand. The Typst compiler (0.15.1), the "
"tree-sitter grammars for Python and Rust, and the HTTP client (``ureq`` "
"with ``rustls``) are ordinary Cargo dependencies, compiled with the "
"workspace. HTTPS needs no ``curl`` program, OpenSSL or system certificate "
"store: the root certificates are built in. There are no native build "
"scripts to run first."
msgstr ""
"其他都不需要手动构建。Typst 编译器（0.15.1）、Python 和 Rust 的 tree-sitter 语法，以及 HTTP "
"客户端（``ureq`` 加 ``rustls``）都是普通的 Cargo 依赖，随 workspace 一起编译。HTTPS 不需要 "
"``curl`` 程序、OpenSSL 或系统证书库：根证书已经内置。没有需要预先运行的原生构建脚本。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:46
msgid "Release build"
msgstr "发布版构建"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:49
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:57
msgid ""
"This links the system's shared Graphviz libraries, so the program needs "
"them at run time."
msgstr "这样会链接系统的 Graphviz 共享库，因此程序运行时需要这些库。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:59
msgid "Static Graphviz"
msgstr "静态链接 Graphviz"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:62
msgid ""
"The release archives link Graphviz statically, so they need no Graphviz "
"on the machine that runs them. We build the same way:"
msgstr "发行归档包以静态方式链接 Graphviz，因此运行它们的机器上不需要安装 Graphviz。我们也可以用同样的方式构建："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:70
msgid ""
"``cargo xtask graphviz`` downloads Graphviz 16.1.0 and Expat 2.7.1, "
"checks each against its pinned SHA-256, and builds static libraries into "
"``target/graphviz/16.1.0``, the folder it prints. It needs a C and C++ "
"compiler, ``make``, ``curl``, ``tar`` and ``xz``, and takes a few "
"minutes. The build has only what Guidedog uses: the dot and neato layout "
"plugins (dot, neato, fdp, sfdp, circo, twopi, osage, patchwork) and the "
"core renderers (SVG and DOT), with no X11, cairo, gd, ltdl or zlib. So a "
"static build renders SVG and laid-out DOT, but not PNG."
msgstr ""
"``cargo xtask graphviz`` 会下载 Graphviz 16.1.0 和 Expat 2.7.1，按固定的 SHA-256 "
"逐一校验，然后把静态库构建到 ``target/graphviz/16.1.0``，并打印这个文件夹。它需要 C 和 C++ "
"编译器、``make``、``curl``、``tar`` 和 ``xz``，耗时几分钟。构建结果只包含 Guidedog 用到的部分：dot 和 "
"neato 布局插件（dot、neato、fdp、sfdp、circo、twopi、osage、patchwork）以及核心渲染器（SVG 和 "
"DOT），不含 X11、cairo、gd、ltdl 和 zlib。因此静态构建可以渲染 SVG 和布局后的 DOT，但不能渲染 PNG。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:72
msgid ""
"``GUIDEDOG_GRAPHVIZ_STATIC`` tells ``gd-graphdog``'s build script where "
"the libraries are; the ``static-graphviz`` feature of ``gd-graphdog`` "
"uses the default folder. ``guidedog --version`` then reports ``graphviz "
"16.1.0 (static)``."
msgstr ""
"``GUIDEDOG_GRAPHVIZ_STATIC`` 告诉 ``gd-graphdog`` 的构建脚本这些库在哪里；``gd-graphdog`` "
"的 ``static-graphviz`` feature 使用默认文件夹。之后 ``guidedog --version`` 会报告 "
"``graphviz 16.1.0 (static)``。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:74
msgid ""
"The executable is ``target/release/guidedog`` (``guidedog.exe`` on "
"Windows). To run ``guidedog`` without its path, we put it on our ``PATH`` "
"or install it into Cargo's binary folder:"
msgstr ""
"可执行文件是 ``target/release/guidedog`` （Windows 上为 "
"``guidedog.exe``）。要不带路径直接运行 ``guidedog``，可以把它加入 ``PATH``，或安装到 Cargo "
"的二进制目录："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:82
msgid ""
"``guidedog formats`` lists the readers and renderers built in, and the "
"Typst backend it found."
msgstr "``guidedog formats`` 列出内置的读取器和渲染器，以及找到的 Typst 后端。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:85
msgid "Typst: embedded or installed"
msgstr "Typst：内嵌还是外部安装"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:88
msgid ""
"By default the Typst compiler is linked into ``guidedog`` (the "
"``embedded`` feature of the ``gd-typst`` crate). PDF then needs no other "
"program. A build of ``gd-typst`` without that feature runs an installed "
"``typst`` program (0.15.1) instead. Either way, "
"``--typst=/absolute/path/to/typst`` (or ``typst`` in ``conf.toml``) "
"selects a program explicitly, and ``guidedog --version`` names the "
"backend in use."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Typst 编译器链接在 ``guidedog`` 中（``gd-typst`` crate 的 ``embedded`` "
"feature）。这样生成 PDF 不需要其他程序。不带该 feature 构建的 ``gd-typst`` 会改为调用已安装的 "
"``typst`` 程序（0.15.1）。无论哪种方式，都可以用 ``--typst=/absolute/path/to/typst`` （或 "
"``conf.toml`` 中的 ``typst``）显式指定程序，``guidedog --version`` 会显示当前使用的后端。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:94
msgid ""
"The embedded compiler removes the need to start a separate process. It "
"does not remove the compiler's own memory costs. ``--budget`` bounds what "
"Guidedog itself holds."
msgstr ""
"内嵌编译器省去了启动独立进程的开销，但编译器本身的内存开销依然存在。``--budget`` 限制的是 Guidedog 自身占用的内存。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:97
msgid "Development checks"
msgstr "开发检查"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:100
msgid ""
"Before we propose a change, we run the same checks as the project's "
"continuous integration:"
msgstr "提交修改之前，我们运行与项目持续集成相同的检查："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:110
msgid ""
"``cargo run -p check`` is the source-limit checker in ``tools/check``: "
"function and file lengths and line widths. ``cargo xtask tables --check`` "
"checks that the generated data tables match the upstream data in "
"``tools/data``. ``cargo xtask --help`` lists the other repository tasks: "
"the website, the fonts, and the release steps."
msgstr ""
"``cargo run -p check`` 是 ``tools/check`` 中的源码限制检查器，检查函数和文件长度以及行宽。``cargo "
"xtask tables --check`` 检查生成的数据表是否与 ``tools/data`` 中的上游数据一致。``cargo xtask "
"--help`` 列出仓库的其他任务：网站、字体和发布步骤。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:113
msgid "Other programs"
msgstr "其他程序"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:116
msgid ""
"``guidedog dsc``, the discussion catalogs, is part of ``guidedog``: the "
"discussion plugin is linked in, so there is nothing more to build. The "
"GitHub Pages publisher builds the same way as ``guidedog``. It does not "
"link the engine:"
msgstr ""
"讨论目录工具 ``guidedog dsc`` 是 ``guidedog`` 的一部分：讨论插件已链接在内，所以不需要再构建别的东西。GitHub "
"Pages 发布程序的构建方式与 ``guidedog`` 相同，它不链接引擎："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:122
msgid ""
"It keeps tokens in the system's credential store: the Keychain on macOS, "
"the Credential Manager on Windows, and on Linux the Secret Service "
"through the ``secret-tool`` program (``libsecret-tools``). It needs that "
"program only when it first stores or reads a token."
msgstr ""
"它把令牌保存在系统的凭据存储中：macOS 上是钥匙串（Keychain），Windows 上是凭据管理器，Linux 上通过 "
"``secret-tool`` 程序（``libsecret-tools``）使用 Secret "
"Service。只有第一次保存或读取令牌时才需要该程序。"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:126
msgid "Embed the engine"
msgstr "嵌入引擎"

#: ../../howto/install.rst:129
msgid ""
"The conversion engine is a library. A Rust program can convert text "
"without the ``guidedog`` command, through the ``guidedoc`` crate and the "
"reader and renderer crates it needs:"
msgstr ""
"转换引擎是一个库。Rust 程序无需 ``guidedog`` 命令即可转换文本，只要依赖 ``guidedoc`` crate "
"及所需的读取器和渲染器 crate："

#: ../../howto/install.rst:156
msgid ""
"``guidedoc_rst::reader()``, ``guidedoc_commonmark::MYST_READER``, "
"``guidedoc_typst::renderer()`` and ``guidedoc_text::renderer()`` join the "
"registry the same way. For code highlighting, the ``guidedoc-defaults`` "
"crate joins the highlighter to the renderers. We pass a "
"``guidedoc_defaults::HtmlHighlighter`` (or ``TypstHighlighter``) as "
"``highlighter`` in the request's ``RenderOptions``. The staged calls "
"(``read_document``, ``transform_document``, ``check_render``, "
"``render_document``), the request fields, and the limits are in the "
"crate's ``README.md``."
msgstr ""
"``guidedoc_rst::reader()``、``guidedoc_commonmark::MYST_READER``、``guidedoc_typst::renderer()`` "
"和 ``guidedoc_text::renderer()`` 以同样的方式加入注册表。代码高亮由 ``guidedoc-defaults`` "
"crate 把高亮器接入渲染器。我们在请求的 ``RenderOptions`` 中把 "
"``guidedoc_defaults::HtmlHighlighter`` （或 ``TypstHighlighter``）作为 "
"``highlighter`` "
"传入。分阶段调用（``read_document``、``transform_document``、``check_render``、``render_document``）、请求字段和各项限制见该 "
"crate 的 ``README.md``。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:1
msgid "Maintain this documentation"
msgstr "维护本项目的文档"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:4
msgid ""
"Guidedog documents itself with Guidedog. The repository has four "
"projects: ``docs/manual`` (this manual), ``docs/api`` (the Rust API "
"reference of the crates), ``docs/gds`` (the design records), and "
"``docs/site`` (the front page). The manual and GDS began with ``guidedog "
"quickstart``. We edit their generated templates in place. Design records "
"stay out of the manual's table of contents."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 用 Guidedog 编写自己的文档。仓库中有四个项目：``docs/manual`` （本手册）、``docs/api`` "
"（各 crate 的 Rust API 参考）、``docs/gds`` （设计记录）和 ``docs/site`` （首页）。手册和 GDS "
"最初由 ``guidedog quickstart`` 创建，我们直接修改生成的模板。设计记录不放进手册的目录树。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:10
msgid ""
"All documentation is reStructuredText under ``docs/``. The only Markdown "
"files are each crate's ``README.md``, a short cheat sheet, and the files "
"GitHub needs at the root. Design notes, internals, ledgers and "
"conformance tables are pages under ``docs/manual/internals``."
msgstr ""
"所有文档都是 ``docs/`` 下的 reStructuredText。仅有的 Markdown 文件是每个 crate 的 "
"``README.md`` （一份简短的速查表），以及 GitHub 需要放在根目录的文件。设计说明、内部实现、台账和一致性表格都是 "
"``docs/manual/internals`` 下的页面。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:15
msgid "Build the manual"
msgstr "构建手册"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:18
msgid ""
"We build ``guidedog`` first (see :doc:`install`). Then, from the "
"repository root:"
msgstr "先构建 ``guidedog`` （见 :doc:`install`），然后在仓库根目录运行："

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:27
msgid ""
"The PDF command creates one book, with links between its chapters. "
"``cargo run --release -p guidedog-cmd -- build html docs/manual -W`` "
"builds and runs in one step."
msgstr ""
"PDF 命令生成一本书，各章之间互相链接。``cargo run --release -p guidedog-cmd -- build html "
"docs/manual -W`` 可以一步完成编译和运行。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:31
msgid "The API reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:34
msgid ""
"``docs/api`` generates its pages from the crates' source with "
"``rust_autoapi_crates`` (see :doc:`document-code`). The reference is the "
"doc comments themselves (``///`` on every public item). There is no "
"copied API manuscript to keep in sync. We fix a mistake in the crate, "
"then rebuild:"
msgstr ""
"``docs/api`` 通过 ``rust_autoapi_crates`` 从各 crate 的源码生成页面（见 "
":doc:`document-code`）。参考内容就是文档注释本身（每个公开项上的 ``///``），没有需要同步维护的 API "
"文稿副本。发现错误时，我们修改 crate，然后重新构建："

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:44
msgid ""
"A warning such as ``rust.autodoc.link`` names the doc comment and the "
"link that does not resolve."
msgstr "``rust.autodoc.link`` 之类的警告会指出是哪条文档注释、哪个链接无法解析。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:47
msgid "Build and check discussions"
msgstr "构建并检查讨论文档"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:57
msgid ""
"``docs/gds`` is a discussion catalog like any other, so ``guidedog dsc`` "
"runs in it (see :doc:`discussions`). It manages metadata, numbers, state, "
"and recovery. Its RST publication path calls the project engine in "
"process. It produces a complete HTML site and a separate PDF for each "
"record. A selector limits the PDFs. HTML remains a coherent site with a "
"complete catalog. A selected PDF preview uses "
"``_build/selected/<artifact>/pdf``. It leaves the complete catalog in "
"``_build/pdf`` intact."
msgstr ""
"``docs/gds`` 和其他讨论目录一样，因此可以在其中运行 ``guidedog dsc``\\ （见 "
":doc:`discussions`）。它管理元数据、编号、状态和恢复。它的 RST 发布流程在进程内调用项目引擎，生成完整的 HTML "
"网站，并为每条记录单独生成 PDF。选择器只限制 PDF 的范围，HTML 始终是带有完整目录的完整网站。选定 PDF 的预览使用 "
"``_build/selected/<artifact>/pdf``，不会影响 ``_build/pdf`` 中的完整目录。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:71
msgid ""
"The ordinary project commands work too. The GDS project uses its own "
"``conf.toml`` and its own ``_build`` directory. Read "
"``docs/gds/workflow.rst`` for the authoring workflow."
msgstr ""
"普通项目命令也适用。GDS 项目使用自己的 ``conf.toml`` 和 ``_build`` 目录。编写流程见 "
"``docs/gds/workflow.rst``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:75
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:78
msgid ""
"The manual's catalogs are in ``docs/manual/locales``. After we change "
"English text, we refresh them:"
msgstr "手册的翻译目录位于 ``docs/manual/locales``。修改英文文本后，我们这样更新它们："

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:86
msgid "See :doc:`../intl` for the translation workflow."
msgstr "翻译流程见 :doc:`../intl`。"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:88
msgid "Before publishing"
msgstr "发布之前"

#: ../../howto/maintain-docs.rst:91
msgid ""
"Check links and diagnostics. Inspect wide tables and code blocks. Render "
"the PDF pages after changing typography. Test the HTML at desktop and "
"phone widths, in light and dark modes. Make sure the mathematics and "
"diagrams work without a network connection. For engine changes, run "
"``cargo test --workspace``, ``cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets`` "
"and ``cargo run -p check``."
msgstr ""
"检查链接和诊断信息。检查宽表格和代码块。修改排版后，渲染 PDF 页面查看效果。在桌面和手机宽度、浅色和深色模式下测试 "
"HTML。确认数学公式和图表在离线时也能正常显示。修改引擎时，运行 ``cargo test --workspace``、``cargo "
"clippy --workspace --all-targets`` 和 ``cargo run -p check``。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:1
msgid "Move a Sphinx project to Guidedog"
msgstr "将 Sphinx 项目迁移到 Guidedog"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:4
msgid ""
"Guidedog follows Sphinx closely. It uses the same directory structure and "
"understands standard reStructuredText and MyST Markdown markup. It "
"recognizes the same configuration setting names and provides Sphinx's "
"Jinja template variables."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 紧跟 Sphinx 的做法。它使用相同的目录结构，能读取标准的 reStructuredText 和 MyST Markdown "
"标记，识别相同的配置项名称，并提供 Sphinx 的 Jinja 模板变量。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:8
msgid ""
"One difference shapes the whole move. Sphinx runs arbitrary Python code "
"in ``conf.py`` and needs a Python virtual environment with external "
"packages. Guidedog is a single compiled program that reads plain data "
"from ``conf.toml``. It does not run Python."
msgstr ""
"有一个区别决定了整个迁移过程。Sphinx 会执行 ``conf.py`` 中的任意 Python 代码，需要一个装有外部包的 Python "
"虚拟环境。Guidedog 是一个编译好的独立程序，只从 ``conf.toml`` 读取纯数据，不执行 Python。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:13
msgid ""
"So moving a project means separating configuration data from Python code."
msgstr "所以，迁移项目就是把配置数据和 Python 代码分开。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:16
msgid "Migration workflow"
msgstr "迁移流程"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:19
msgid "The move goes through these steps:"
msgstr "迁移分为以下几步："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:23
msgid ""
"conf.py is converted by guidedog migrate into conf.toml, followed by "
"semantic verification, custom object mapping, and visual inspection."
msgstr "guidedog migrate 将 conf.py 转为 conf.toml，再进行语义检查、自定义对象映射和外观检查。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:23
msgid ""
"The step-by-step workflow for migrating a Sphinx project to Guidedog."
msgstr "从 Sphinx 迁移到 Guidedog 的分步流程。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:42
msgid "Step 1: Automated configuration migration"
msgstr "第一步：自动迁移配置"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:45
msgid "Guidedog has a migration tool that parses our existing ``conf.py``:"
msgstr "Guidedog 提供迁移工具，可以解析现有的 ``conf.py``："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:51
msgid "What ``guidedog migrate`` does:"
msgstr "``guidedog migrate`` 会完成以下工作："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:53
msgid ""
"It extracts literal configuration values (strings, numbers, booleans, "
"lists, and tables) and converts them to standard TOML syntax in "
"``conf.toml``."
msgstr "提取字符串、数字、布尔值、列表和表等字面值，在 ``conf.toml`` 中写成标准 TOML。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:55
msgid ""
"It detects standard Sphinx settings (such as ``project``, ``author``, "
"``extensions``, ``templates_path``, ``html_theme``, "
"``intersphinx_mapping``, and ``html_context``) and maps them."
msgstr ""
"它会识别并映射标准的 Sphinx 设置（如 "
"``project``、``author``、``extensions``、``templates_path``、``html_theme``、``intersphinx_mapping`` "
"和 ``html_context``）。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:58
msgid ""
"It finds computed expressions (such as Python calls like ``version = "
"get_version()`` or ``git_revision = subprocess.check_output(...)``). "
"Guidedog does not run Python, so its migration report flags these values. "
"We then give fixed values for them in ``conf.toml``."
msgstr ""
"它会找出计算得出的表达式（例如 ``version = get_version()`` 或 ``git_revision = "
"subprocess.check_output(...)`` 这样的 Python 调用）。Guidedog 不执行 "
"Python，所以迁移报告会标出这些值，我们再在 ``conf.toml`` 中为它们填写固定值。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:63
msgid ""
"We review the generated ``conf.toml`` and replace each flagged expression "
"with a fixed value."
msgstr "检查生成的 ``conf.toml``，把每个被标出的表达式替换为固定值。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:65
msgid "Step 2: The three-pass verification strategy"
msgstr "第二步：分三轮验证"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:68
msgid ""
"Once ``conf.toml`` exists, we work through the migration in three passes:"
msgstr "有了 ``conf.toml`` 之后，我们分三轮完成迁移："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:70
msgid "Pass 1: Verify the document graph"
msgstr "第一轮：检查文档图"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:73
msgid ""
"We check that Guidedog finds all documents and builds the expected "
"hierarchy:"
msgstr "确认 Guidedog 找到了所有文档，并建立了预期的层级结构："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:75
msgid ""
"Verify that ``root_doc`` names our main entry point (usually ``index`` or "
"``contents``)."
msgstr "确认 ``root_doc`` 指向主入口（通常是 ``index`` 或 ``contents``）。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:76
msgid ""
"Confirm that ``source_suffix`` lists every extension we use (for example, "
"``[\".rst\", \".md\"]``)."
msgstr "确认 ``source_suffix`` 列出了用到的所有扩展名（例如 ``[\".rst\", \".md\"]``）。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:77
msgid ""
"Check that ``exclude_patterns`` excludes build folders, virtual "
"environments, and temporary files."
msgstr "检查 ``exclude_patterns`` 是否排除了构建目录、虚拟环境和临时文件。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:78
msgid "Run a quick semantic check using the dummy builder:"
msgstr "用 dummy 构建器快速检查语义："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:84
msgid ""
"The dummy builder checks every document and link without writing HTML "
"files. We fix each warning about a missing document or a malformed "
"include."
msgstr "dummy 构建器会检查每个文档和链接，但不写出 HTML 文件。逐一修复关于文档缺失或 include 写法错误的警告。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:87
msgid "Pass 2: Verify references, domains, and custom objects"
msgstr "第二轮：检查引用、域和自定义对象"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:90
msgid "Next, we verify that cross-references and domain directives resolve:"
msgstr "接下来，确认交叉引用和各个域的指令都能解析："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Standard domains:** Guidedog supports the standard Python, C, C++, and "
"JavaScript domains, with their roles such as ``:py:func:``, ``:c:type:``, "
"and ``:cpp:class:``. It adds ``odin`` and ``rust`` domains of its own "
"(see :doc:`../topics/domains`)."
msgstr ""
"**标准域：** Guidedog 支持标准的 Python、C、C++ 和 JavaScript 域，以及 "
"``:py:func:``、``:c:type:``、``:cpp:class:`` 等相应角色。它还自带 ``odin`` 和 ``rust`` "
"域（见 :doc:`../topics/domains`）。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Intersphinx links:** If our Sphinx project linked to external "
"documentation through Intersphinx, we keep our ``[intersphinx_mapping]`` "
"in ``conf.toml``. Guidedog fetches and parses standard ``objects.inv`` "
"files itself."
msgstr ""
"**Intersphinx 链接：** 如果原来的 Sphinx 项目通过 Intersphinx 链接外部文档，就在 ``conf.toml`` "
"中保留 ``[intersphinx_mapping]``。Guidedog 会自行获取并解析标准的 ``objects.inv`` 文件。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Declarative custom object types:** In Sphinx, projects often wrote "
"small Python extensions that call ``app.add_object_type()`` to create "
"custom directives and roles (such as ``.. confval::`` or ``.. "
"setting::``). In Guidedog, we declare these in ``conf.toml`` under "
"``[[object_types]]``, without code. See :doc:`../object-types`."
msgstr ""
"**声明式自定义对象类型：** 在 Sphinx 中，项目常常写一个调用 ``app.add_object_type()`` 的小型 Python "
"扩展，来创建自定义指令和角色（如 ``.. confval::`` 或 ``.. setting::``）。在 Guidedog 中，只需在 "
"``conf.toml`` 的 ``[[object_types]]`` 下声明，无需写代码。见 :doc:`../object-types`。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:103
msgid "Pass 3: Verify presentation and templates"
msgstr "第三轮：检查呈现效果和模板"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:106
msgid "Finally, we check how the output looks:"
msgstr "最后，检查输出效果："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:108
msgid ""
"**HTML website:** Run ``guidedog build html path/to/docs -W`` and inspect "
"the generated pages."
msgstr "**HTML 网站：** 运行 ``guidedog build html path/to/docs -W``，查看生成页面。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Jinja templates:** Guidedog's native Jinja engine supports block "
"inheritance:"
msgstr "**Jinja 模板：** Guidedog 的原生 Jinja 引擎支持块继承："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:118
msgid ""
"**PDF books:** Build a PDF book with ``guidedog build pdf path/to/docs "
"-W``. Guidedog typesets the book with Typst and ``_templates/book.typ``. "
"It gives vector math, proper hyphenation, and running headers without a "
"LaTeX installation."
msgstr ""
"**PDF 书籍：** 用 ``guidedog build pdf path/to/docs -W`` 构建 PDF 书籍。Guidedog "
"使用 Typst 和 ``_templates/book.typ`` 排版，无需安装 LaTeX 即可得到矢量公式、正确的断词和页眉。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:122
msgid "Configuration settings mapping"
msgstr "配置项对照"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:125
msgid ""
"Common Sphinx ``conf.py`` variables correspond to Guidedog's "
"``conf.toml`` like this:"
msgstr "常用的 Sphinx ``conf.py`` 变量与 Guidedog ``conf.toml`` 的对应关系如下："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:127
msgid "Common configuration mapping"
msgstr "常用配置对照"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:131
msgid "Sphinx (conf.py)"
msgstr "Sphinx（conf.py）"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:132
msgid "Guidedog (conf.toml)"
msgstr "Guidedog（conf.toml）"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:133
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:134
msgid "``project = 'Manual'``"
msgstr "``project = 'Manual'``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:135
msgid "``project = \"Manual\"``"
msgstr "``project = \"Manual\"``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:136
msgid "Standard string setting."
msgstr "普通字符串设置。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:137
msgid "``version = '1.0'``"
msgstr "``version = '1.0'``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:138
msgid "``version = \"1.0\"``"
msgstr "``version = \"1.0\"``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:139
msgid "Documented version number."
msgstr "文档对应的版本号。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:140 ../../howto/migrate.rst:141
msgid "``extensions = [...]``"
msgstr "``extensions = [...]``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:142
msgid "Built-in extensions (graphviz, mathjax, intersphinx, myst_parser)."
msgstr "内置扩展（graphviz、mathjax、intersphinx、myst_parser）。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:143
msgid "``source_suffix = ['.rst', '.md']``"
msgstr "``source_suffix = ['.rst', '.md']``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:144
msgid "``source_suffix = [\".rst\", \".md\"]``"
msgstr "``source_suffix = [\".rst\", \".md\"]``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:145
msgid "Supported source formats."
msgstr "支持的源文件格式。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:146
msgid "``root_doc = 'index'``"
msgstr "``root_doc = 'index'``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:147
msgid "``root_doc = \"index\"``"
msgstr "``root_doc = \"index\"``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:148
msgid "Entry document name (without extension)."
msgstr "入口文档名，不带扩展名。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:149
msgid "``html_static_path = ['_static']``"
msgstr "``html_static_path = ['_static']``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:150
msgid "``html_static_path = [\"_static\"]``"
msgstr "``html_static_path = [\"_static\"]``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:151
msgid "Custom styles and script folders."
msgstr "自定义样式和脚本目录。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:152
msgid "``templates_path = ['_templates']``"
msgstr "``templates_path = ['_templates']``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:153
msgid "``templates_path = [\"_templates\"]``"
msgstr "``templates_path = [\"_templates\"]``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:154
msgid "Jinja template directory."
msgstr "Jinja 模板目录。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:155
msgid "``html_context = {...}``"
msgstr "``html_context = {...}``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:156
msgid "``[html_context]``"
msgstr "``[html_context]``"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:157
msgid "Passed directly to Jinja templates."
msgstr "直接传入 Jinja 模板。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:159
msgid "Handling custom Python extensions"
msgstr "处理自定义 Python 扩展"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:162
msgid ""
"Some Sphinx projects rely on large Python extensions that inspect Python "
"ASTs or modify Sphinx's internal classes. For those, we have three "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"有些 Sphinx 项目依赖大型 Python 扩展，这些扩展会分析 Python AST 或修改 Sphinx 的内部类。对此有三种做法："

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:165
msgid ""
"**Declarative object types:** If the extension only created custom "
"directives or roles, we replace it with ``[[object_types]]`` in "
"``conf.toml``."
msgstr ""
"**声明式对象类型：** 如果扩展只是创建自定义指令或角色，就改用 ``conf.toml`` 中的 ``[[object_types]]``。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Build plugins:** If the extension transformed source text, added custom "
"HTML wrappers, or generated static assets, we write a build plugin in "
"Rust with the ``gd-plugins`` crate's typed interface described in "
":doc:`../plugins`. The same plugin runs as an installed program "
"(``guidedog plugin register``) or linked into our own ``guidedog`` binary "
"through ``gd_cli::run_with``."
msgstr ""
"**构建插件：** 如果扩展会转换源文本、添加自定义 HTML 包装或生成静态资源，就用 Rust 编写构建插件，使用 "
":doc:`../plugins` 中介绍的 ``gd-plugins`` crate "
"的类型化接口。同一个插件既可以作为已安装的程序运行（``guidedog plugin register``），也可以通过 "
"``gd_cli::run_with`` 链接进我们自己的 ``guidedog`` 二进制文件。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:172
msgid ""
"**Static API extraction:** Guidedog already reads Python docstrings, Odin "
"declarations, and Rust doc comments without running the documented code. "
"Use :doc:`document-code`. Runtime-generated objects may need explicit RST "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"**静态 API 提取：** Guidedog 已经能读取 Python docstring、Odin 声明和 Rust "
"文档注释，无需运行被记录的代码。见 :doc:`document-code`。运行时生成的对象可能需要用 RST 显式描述。"

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:176
msgid ""
":doc:`../compatibility` gives the evidence for Sphinx compatibility and "
"the limits that remain."
msgstr ":doc:`../compatibility` 列出了 Sphinx 兼容性的依据和仍然存在的限制。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:1
msgid "Build and publish documentation"
msgstr "构建并发布文档"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:4
msgid ""
"To publish documentation, we turn reStructuredText and Markdown sources "
"into static files, check them, and deploy them to a host."
msgstr "发布文档，就是把 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 源文件转换为静态文件，检查无误后部署到托管环境。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:7
msgid "Guidedog keeps building a site separate from deploying it:"
msgstr "Guidedog 把构建网站和部署网站分开："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Building:** Guidedog reads our sources, compiles templates, and "
"resolves cross-references. It writes a complete, checked folder of static "
"HTML files or a typeset PDF book."
msgstr ""
"**构建：** Guidedog 读取源文件、编译模板并解析交叉引用，写出一个完整且经过检查的静态 HTML 目录，或一本排好版的 PDF 书籍。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Publishing:** Our web server serves the static files, or we deploy them "
"to a host such as GitHub Pages, an S3 bucket, or an internal file server."
msgstr ""
"**发布：** 由我们自己的 Web 服务器提供这些静态文件，或者把它们部署到 GitHub Pages、S3 存储桶、内部文件服务器等托管环境。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:14
msgid ""
"The output is plain static files (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and SVG). Any "
"static web server (such as Nginx, Apache, or Caddy) can serve it. "
"Production needs no Guidedog, no Python interpreter, and no running "
"server process."
msgstr ""
"输出是纯静态文件（HTML、CSS、JavaScript 和 SVG），任何静态 Web 服务器（如 Nginx、Apache 或 "
"Caddy）都能提供访问。生产环境不需要 Guidedog，不需要 Python 解释器，也不需要常驻的服务进程。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:18
msgid "Atomic publication architecture"
msgstr "原子发布架构"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:21
msgid ""
"Guidedog publishes only complete output generations. The host finishes "
"preparation before it decides a journaled commit. A failed preparation "
"leaves the previous site intact."
msgstr "Guidedog 只发布完整的一代输出。主机先完成准备工作，再决定提交日志事务。准备失败时，上一版网站保持不变。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:25
msgid ""
"Guidedog prepares a complete generation before deciding a journaled "
"commit:"
msgstr "Guidedog 先准备完整的一代输出，再决定日志化提交："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:29
msgid ""
"A complete staged generation is journaled and switched into place. "
"Recovery finishes or restores an interrupted commit."
msgstr "完整的暂存输出先记入日志，再切换到目标位置。恢复过程会完成或撤销中断的提交。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:29
msgid "The atomic staging and generation switch process."
msgstr "原子暂存与代际切换流程。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:47
msgid "How atomic commits protect our site:"
msgstr "原子提交如何保护网站："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Staging:** All newly rendered pages are written to a hidden staging "
"folder (``.<target>.next``). For the default builders it sits in the "
"build folder. For an output we name with ``-o``, it sits inside the "
"output's one cache folder beside it (``.<target>.guidedog``), so the "
"output gains a single hidden neighbour."
msgstr ""
"**暂存：** 所有新渲染的页面都先写入一个隐藏的暂存文件夹（``.<target>.next``）。对于默认构建器，它位于构建文件夹中。对于我们用 "
"``-o`` 指定的输出，它位于输出旁边唯一的缓存文件夹（``.<target>.guidedog``）中，因此输出旁边只会多出一个隐藏的文件夹。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Isolation:** The live output folder stays untouched while pages compile."
msgstr "**隔离：** 编译页面期间，线上输出目录保持不动。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Failure safety:** If any page fails to render, or a warning becomes an "
"error under ``-W``, the build abandons the staging folder. The live site "
"stays unchanged."
msgstr "**失败保护：** 只要有页面渲染失败，或在 ``-W`` 下有警告变成错误，构建就会放弃暂存目录，线上网站保持不变。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Atomic swap:** Once all files are flushed, Guidedog switches the "
"staging folder into place. Where the filesystem supports it, this is a "
"single directory exchange."
msgstr "**原子交换：** 所有文件写入磁盘后，Guidedog 把暂存目录切换到位。在支持的文件系统上，这是一次目录交换操作。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Interrupted recovery:** If a crash interrupts the swap, the next build "
"reads the durable journal. It settles the interrupted commit instead of "
"guessing."
msgstr "**中断恢复：** 如果切换过程中发生崩溃，下次构建会读取持久化日志，明确地完成被中断的提交，而不是靠猜测。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:61
msgid "Standard build workflow"
msgstr "常规构建流程"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:64
msgid ""
"To build both HTML and PDF outputs into the default project output "
"directory:"
msgstr "将 HTML 和 PDF 构建到项目默认的输出目录："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:71
msgid "Output locations:"
msgstr "输出位置："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:73
msgid "The HTML website is written to ``docs/manual/_build/html/``."
msgstr "HTML 网站写入 ``docs/manual/_build/html/``。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:74
msgid "The PDF book is written to ``docs/manual/_build/pdf/``."
msgstr "PDF 书籍写入 ``docs/manual/_build/pdf/``。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:76
msgid ""
"The ``-j auto`` flag parallelizes document parsing across all available "
"CPU cores."
msgstr "``-j auto`` 使用所有可用 CPU 核心并行解析文档。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:78
msgid "Custom output directories"
msgstr "自定义输出目录"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:81
msgid ""
"To write the site to a folder of our choice (for example, in a CI/CD "
"pipeline or a deployment script), we use the Sphinx-compatible command "
"form:"
msgstr "要把网站写到自己指定的目录（例如在 CI/CD 流水线或部署脚本中），使用与 Sphinx 兼容的命令形式："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:88
msgid "Guidedog enforces safety constraints on output paths:"
msgstr "Guidedog 对输出路径有以下约束："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:90
msgid ""
"Choose a dedicated output folder, such as ``_build/html`` inside the "
"project or ``build/site`` beside it. The output must not be the source "
"root or one of its ancestors, because switching it would replace the "
"source project."
msgstr ""
"选择专用输出目录，例如项目内的 ``_build/html``，或项目旁的 "
"``build/site``。输出不能是源目录本身或其上级目录，否则代际切换会替换整个源项目。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:93
msgid ""
"For a custom destination such as ``build/site``, Guidedog keeps its "
"internal caches in a sibling folder (such as "
"``build/.site.guidedog/.doctrees``). The published folder then holds only "
"the static files we deploy."
msgstr ""
"输出到 ``build/site`` 这样的自定义位置时，Guidedog 把内部缓存放在同级目录中（如 "
"``build/.site.guidedog/.doctrees``）。这样，发布目录中只有我们要部署的静态文件。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:97
msgid "Semantic checks and pre-flight validation"
msgstr "语义检查与构建前验证"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:100
msgid ""
"To check a project without writing HTML files to disk, we use the "
"``dummy`` builder:"
msgstr "要检查项目但不把 HTML 文件写入磁盘，使用 ``dummy`` 构建器："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:107
msgid "The dummy builder:"
msgstr "dummy 构建器会："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:109
msgid "Reads and parses all documents."
msgstr "读取并解析所有文档。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:110
msgid ""
"Resolves all toctrees, headings, cross-references, and domain objects."
msgstr "解析目录树、标题、交叉引用和域对象。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:111
msgid ""
"Checks document references and domain objects (``-n`` enables nitpicky "
"cross-reference checking). It does not make HTTP requests to test "
"external URLs."
msgstr "检查文档引用和域对象，``-n`` 开启严格的交叉引用检查。它不会发送 HTTP 请求来测试外部网址。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:113
msgid "Exits with status 1 if any broken link or warning is found (``-W``)."
msgstr "若有未解析的链接或警告，``-W`` 使其以状态码 1 退出。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:115
msgid ""
"In continuous integration, the dummy builder is a fast check to run "
"before the full site build."
msgstr "在持续集成中，可以先用 dummy 构建器做一次快速检查，再构建完整网站。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:118
msgid "Reproducible build timestamps"
msgstr "可复现的构建时间"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:121
msgid ""
"Documentation builds often embed timestamps (for example, in \"Last "
"updated\" footer notices). When an automated deployment must give the "
"same bytes on every run, we pin the clock with the standard "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"文档构建经常嵌入时间戳（例如页脚的“最后更新”提示）。如果自动部署要求每次运行生成完全相同的字节，就用标准环境变量 "
"``SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`` 固定时钟："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:129
msgid ""
"When this variable is set, Guidedog uses the specified Unix epoch "
"timestamp instead of the current system clock for all date formatting and "
"template variables."
msgstr "设置后，日期格式化和模板变量均使用指定的 Unix 时间戳，而非当前系统时间。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:132
msgid "Deployment options"
msgstr "部署方式"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:135
msgid "Once the build succeeds, we deploy the static files to our host:"
msgstr "构建成功后，把静态文件部署到托管环境："

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Static web servers (Nginx / Caddy / Apache):** Point the server's root "
"directive directly to the built HTML directory."
msgstr "**静态 Web 服务器（Nginx / Caddy / Apache）：** 将服务器根目录指向生成的 HTML 目录。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:139
msgid ""
"**Cloud storage buckets (AWS S3 / Cloudflare R2 / Google Cloud "
"Storage):** Sync the contents of ``_build/html`` to our bucket with the "
"cloud provider's CLI tool."
msgstr ""
"**云存储桶（AWS S3 / Cloudflare R2 / Google Cloud Storage）：** 用云服务商的命令行工具把 "
"``_build/html`` 的内容同步到存储桶。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:141
msgid "**GitHub Pages:**"
msgstr "**GitHub Pages：**"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:143
msgid ""
"To deploy directly from our own machine, we run ``guidedog publish "
"pages``. It asks for what is still missing (the repository, a token, the "
"Pages settings), then builds and publishes in one push. "
"``guidedog pages`` offers the same steps one by one. See "
":doc:`github-pages`."
msgstr ""
"要直接从本机部署，运行 ``guidedog publish pages``。它会询问还缺少的信息（仓库、令牌、Pages "
"设置），然后一次完成构建和推送发布。``guidedog pages`` 提供逐步执行的相同步骤。见 :doc:`github-pages`。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:147
msgid ""
"For automated deployments with GitHub Actions, ``guidedog pages "
"workflow`` writes a workflow that builds and deploys the site. See "
":doc:`github-pages`."
msgstr ""
"如果用 GitHub Actions 自动部署，``guidedog pages workflow`` 会生成一个构建并部署网站的工作流。见 "
":doc:`github-pages`。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:149
msgid ""
"For any other destination, we write a publisher plugin as described in "
":doc:`../plugins` and run it with ``guidedog publish --publisher=ID``."
msgstr ""
"部署到其他目标时，按 :doc:`../plugins` 的说明编写发布插件，并用 ``guidedog publish "
"--publisher=ID`` 运行。"

#: ../../howto/publish.rst:152
msgid ""
"On filesystems with directory exchange, the output path switches in one "
"operation. The fallback uses two renames and can briefly leave that path "
"absent. It still never exposes a partly assembled tree. Journal recovery "
"finishes or restores an interrupted switch. A client making several "
"requests can span two generations. The build does not promise one "
"snapshot for a whole browsing session."
msgstr ""
"在支持目录交换的文件系统上，输出路径一步完成切换。回退方案使用两次重命名，期间该路径可能短暂不存在，但绝不会暴露拼装到一半的目录树。日志恢复会完成或还原被中断的切换。客户端的多次请求可能跨越两代输出；构建并不保证整个浏览会话看到同一个快照。"
